                "text": "The new tax law cuts critical federal funding that will make it harder for people in Hawai\u2018i to access health care, food assistance, and other important services. While we are working every day to blunt the impact of these cuts, everyone should know what\u2019s coming, how to prepare, and where to find help.\n\u00a0\nCheck out our new resource guide: https://t.co/NToJ8UPudS",
